CHAPTER.VERS:
--and the life was manifested, and we have seen, and bear witness, and declare to you

          {+}
         the life, the eternal [life], which was with the Father, and was manifested to us--

that which we have seen and heard we declare to you

          {+}
         also, that you

          {+}
         also may have fellowship with us: yes, and our fellowship is with the Father, and with his Son Jesus Christ:

And this is the message which we have heard from him and announce to you

          {+}
        , that God is light, and in him is no darkness at all.
